<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's John Holt 6-mth profits slide.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's John Holt 6-mth profits slide.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year results for Nigerian conglomerate John Holt Plc to end-March 1997. (In million naira).</p>
<p>					 1997     1996</p>
<p>Turnover			     3,500 vs 3,300</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	   170.9 vs 214.8</p>
<p>Taxation				54.7 vs 0.0</p>
<p>Tax credit			     0.0 vs 36.1</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	    116.2 vs 251.0</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 273 03 17</p>
